=== a single run never empties a file that holds something ===
PASS: the built-in engine starts out holding whitespace
PASS: the built-in engine exits 1
PASS: the built-in engine names the file
PASS: the built-in engine says what it would not do
PASS: the built-in engine leaves the file as it was
PASS: the 1z engine starts out holding whitespace
PASS: the 1z engine exits 1
PASS: the 1z engine names the file
PASS: the 1z engine says what it would not do
PASS: the 1z engine leaves the file as it was
